From: Antheas Kapenekakis <git@antheas.dev>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 21:32:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] add CEC support via DP to HDMI dongles


Upstream: https://github.com/anatase-org/open-gpu-kernel-modules/commit/2fa83dac159ee4be2f2e08be8f211aadf6a65c5c
Rebased for NVIDIA 595.104.02 after Nobara's existing patch stack.
Adapt the event/function-table additions to the 595 interfaces and preserve
subDeviceInstance when issuing AUX transactions.

